Report float and half-float color attachments on GL and GLES.

- source/renderer/ore/gl/ore_context_gl.cpp: Ore GL features: report float and half-float color attachments on desktop GL, where they are core since 3.0 and the ES-only GL_EXT_color_buffer_float is never listed; desktop GL 4.3+ also reports storageBuffers when fragment shaders can bind shader storage blocks
- source/renderer/ore/gl/ore_context_gl.cpp: Ore GL features: detect GL_EXT_color_buffer_half_float on OpenGL ES, which makes 16-bit float color attachments renderable without the full-float extension

